    "Both models accept short audio using the installed application transport shape and system proxy.",
    "Flash native HTTP/2 proxied nonstreaming failed with -1005 about 63 seconds after upload; a second proxied unary call returned 429.",
    "Both Flash and Argon completed the identical 20-minute synthetic audio through streaming responses over HTTP/2 with the system proxy.",
    "Python HTTP/1.1 unary succeeded both without an HTTP proxy and with the explicit localhost HTTP proxy. The proxied run had a shorter inference wait, so protocol versus proxy idle timeout remains unresolved.",
    "The Swift bypass attempt was not a valid direct control; metrics reported a proxy connection.",
    "Each condition has one or two observations and model latency varies. STOP validates API completion, not transcription accuracy."
  ],
  "recommendation": "Prioritize a bounded Vertex streaming-response implementation with terminal STOP validation, partial-response rejection on disconnect, final usage handling, existing cancellation/deadlines and 429 cooldown. Keep AI Studio as the currently successful user workflow while this is implemented and verified.",
